To implement the **"starts with"** search logic across your controllers, we are refining the endpoints to ensure they pass the raw prefix directly to your services. This change allows the Oracle database to perform an **Index Range Scan**, which is significantly faster and more accurate than a broad "containing" search for financial data like Branch Codes and CGLs.
